      "domain": "BIZ",
      "body": "Cross-border creator/commerce recommendations require explicit language acquisition path. Vietnamese founder + Portuguese market = +3 difficulty multiplier. Recommending \"build Brazil training business\" to a no-Portuguese founder is structurally unsound."
